{
  "sourceLanguage": "ja",
  "strings": {
    "スパム・宣伝": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spam or advertising"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "嫌がらせ・いじめ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Harassment or bullying"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不適切・わいせつな内容（画像・動画含む）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inappropriate or obscene content (including images and videos)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "暴力的・違法な内容": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Violent or illegal content"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "その他": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Other"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ との安全番号": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Safety number with %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ の安全番号が一致しました。この会話は途中で盗み見られていません。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@'s safety number matches. This conversation hasn't been eavesdropped on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@、%@ にすれ違い": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Crossed paths with %@ at %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@のメッセージ、%@、%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@'s message, %2$@, %3$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lldつの岸を漂って": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drifted across %lld shores"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lldつの岸を漂って届いた投稿": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A post that drifted across %lld shores"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld歳以上です": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I am %lld or older"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1時間": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 hour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1週間": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 week"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "24時間": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "24 hours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth をオンにして、画面を開いたままにしておきましょう。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on Bluetooth and keep this screen open."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth 権限": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetooth Permission"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetoothをオンにしてください": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Please turn on Bluetooth"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth：すれ違った人とことばを届け合うために使います。\n通知：近くの人や DM の着信に気づくために使います。\n\n位置情報やアカウント登録は要りません。この後、必要になったときに端末が確認します。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetooth: used to exchange words with people you cross paths with.\nNotifications: used to let you know about people nearby and incoming DMs.\n\nNo location access or account sign-up is required. Your device will ask later, when it's needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Central（スキャン側）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Central (Scanner)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DriftSonar の安全番号 QR ではありません。相手の「安全番号」画面を読み取ってください。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That's not a DriftSonar safety-number QR. Scan the other person's Safety Number screen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DriftSonar はサーバーを持たず、すべての通信は端末間の Bluetooth で完結します。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DriftSonar has no server; all communication happens directly between devices over Bluetooth."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DriftSonar は端末同士が直接つながる、サーバーを持たない SNS です。投稿の中央監視は行われないため、健全な利用は一人ひとりの行動と端末側の機能で守られます。ご利用の前に以下に同意してください。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DriftSonar is a serverless social app where devices connect directly. There is no central moderation of posts, so a healthy space depends on each person's conduct and the on-device tools. Please agree to the following before you begin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DriftSonar は近くの端末と Bluetooth ですれ違うことで投稿やメッセージを運びます。オンのままにすると、アプリを開いていないときも受け渡しが続き、離れていても内容が届きやすくなります。オフにすると、アプリを閉じている間は通信を停止します（次にアプリを開いたときに再開します）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DriftSonar carries posts and messages by passing nearby devices over Bluetooth. Left on, exchanges continue even when the app isn't open, so content reaches you more easily from a distance. Turned off, communication stops while the app is closed (it resumes the next time you open the app)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Peripheral（広告側）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Peripheral (Advertiser)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "QR をスキャン": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan QR"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "QR コードを生成できません": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Can't generate the QR code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「同意して始める」を押すと、上記の利用規約と禁止事項、および%lld歳以上であることの確認に同意したものとみなされます。違反した場合、当該コンテンツの非表示やブロックの対象となります。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "By tapping “Agree and Start,” you agree to the terms and prohibitions above and confirm that you are %lld or older. Violations may result in the content being hidden or blocked."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あとで設定からいつでも変更できます": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can change this anytime in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あと約%lld分で消えます": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disappears in about %lld minutes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あと約%lld時間で消えます": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disappears in about %lld hours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あなたにまっすぐ届いた投稿": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A post that reached you directly"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あなたの投稿": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your Posts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あなたの鍵ペアは、この端末の中だけで生成・保管されます": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your key pair is generated and stored only on this device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いいえ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いま、波間に流したいことは？": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What do you want to set adrift?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いまは凪いでいます": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All is calm now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "うち新規受理": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Newly Accepted"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "うち棄却（重複・無効等）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rejected (Duplicate/Invalid, etc.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ここは二人だけの入江": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A cove for just the two of you"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この QR コードを相手に読み取らせると\nあなたの公開鍵を共有できます": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Have someone scan this QR code\nto share your public key."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このあと送受信するメッセージは%@で消えます": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Messages sent and received from now on disappear after %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このボトルには収まりきらないようです。短い動画や小さめの画像でもう一度お試しください。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This won't fit in the bottle. Try a shorter video or a smaller image."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このユーザーの投稿が再び表示されるようになります。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This user's posts will be shown again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このユーザーをブロック": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Block This User"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この会話は二人の入江に閉じています（端末間 E2E 暗号化）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This conversation is closed to the two of you (device-to-device E2E encryption)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この名前で海へ出る": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set out to sea with this name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この形式のメディアはまだ流せません。別のファイルをお試しください。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This media format can't be set adrift yet. Try another file."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この投稿を通報": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Report This Post"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この相手は確認済みです": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This contact is verified"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この端末の暗号鍵が見つかりませんでした。アプリの再インストールやバックアップ復元で鍵が失われた可能性があります。プロフィールを作り直すと再び利用できます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This device's encryption keys couldn't be found. They may have been lost during a reinstall or backup restore. Recreating your profile lets you use the app again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ご利用にあたって": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Before You Begin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "すれ違いの記録": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Encounter History"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "すれ違い成立数": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Encounters"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "すれ違った誰かが、ここに流れ着きます": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anyone you cross paths with will drift ashore here"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "はい": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "はじめる": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Get Started"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "はじめる前に、二つだけ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Two Things Before You Begin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まだ何も流れ着いていません": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing has drifted ashore yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まだ誰ともすれ違っていません": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You haven't crossed paths with anyone yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まだ誰の投稿も流れ着いていません。近くで誰かが DriftSonar を開くまで、あなたの漂流を映しています。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing has drifted ashore yet. Until someone nearby opens DriftSonar, this shows your own drift."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まだ誰も波間に見えません": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No one is in the waves yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まっすぐ届いた": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reached you directly"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まもなく消えます": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disappearing soon"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "もう一度スキャンして確認": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan again to verify"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "もう一度耳を澄ます": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Listen again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "やり取りは端末間で\nエンドツーエンド暗号化され、\nほかの誰にも流れ着きません。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your exchange is end-to-end encrypted\nbetween devices and\ndrifts to no one else."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アカウント": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アカウントも、クラウドの履歴もありません。あえてオフグリッドの、秘密の話に閉じた小さな SNS です。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There are no accounts and no cloud history. It's a small, deliberately off-grid social app closed around private conversations."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アカウントを削除": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete Account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アカウントを削除しますか？": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete your account?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アプリについて": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アプリを閉じている間も近くの端末とすれ違い通信を続けます。その分バッテリーを消費します。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keeps exchanging with nearby devices even while the app is closed. This uses extra battery."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アプリ内の通報・ブロックに加えて、不適切なコンテンツや迷惑なユーザーを開発者へ直接メールで報告できます。いただいた報告には24時間以内に対応し、該当コンテンツの削除と違反ユーザーの排除を行います。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In addition to in-app reporting and blocking, you can email the developer directly about inappropriate content or troublesome users. Reports are addressed within 24 hours, removing the content in question and barring the offending user."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "オフ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "オープンソースライセンス": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Source Licenses"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カメラを使えません": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Camera unavailable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キャンセル": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
