        }
      }
    },
    "信頼する相手との会話は、二人の端末だけで解ける暗号（エンドツーエンド暗号化）に閉じます。ほかの誰にも、私たちにも読めません。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conversations with people you trust are closed inside encryption only your two devices can open (end-to-end encryption). No one else — not even we — can read them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
