    "友だちを招待（QRコード）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invite a Friend (QR Code)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "友だちを誘って同時に開くと、最初のすれ違いが生まれます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invite a friend to open it at the same time for your first encounter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "受信した投稿数": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Posts Received"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "受信数 = 新規受理数 + 棄却数。棄却には重複・期限切れ・署名不正・レート超過が含まれます。送出数は定期再ゴシップによる再送も数えます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Received = newly accepted + rejected. Rejections include duplicates, expiry, invalid signatures, and rate-limit overflow. Sends also count resends from periodic re-gossip."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ部屋くらいの距離です": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About a room away"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同意して始める": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agree and Start"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "名前のない漂流者": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nameless drifter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "名前を伏せて流します。誰の手紙かは、届いた先でも分かりません。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sent without your name. No one downstream can tell whose letter it is."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "名前未取得のユーザー": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "User (name unavailable)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "変更は即時に反映され、再起動後も保持されます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changes take effect immediately and are kept after you relaunch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "嫌がらせ・脅迫・差別・わいせつ・違法な内容など、不快・不適切な投稿は固く禁止します。これはテキストだけでなく、添付する画像・動画にも等しく適用されます。これらに対して一切の許容はありません。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Harassment, threats, discrimination, obscenity, illegal content, and any other objectionable or inappropriate posts are strictly prohibited. This applies equally to text and to attached images and videos. There is zero tolerance for such content."
          }
        }
      }
    },
