            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Far away"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "電波が届く数十メートルの人へ、サーバーを通さず直接ことばが漂います。すれ違うたび、投稿は人から人へ運ばれて広がっていきます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Words drift directly, with no server, to people within tens of meters. Each time you cross paths, posts are carried from person to person and spread."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "電波の強さ %lld dBm、%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Signal strength %lld dBm, %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "電波は数十メートル届きます。近くに誰かいれば自然とつながります。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The signal reaches tens of meters. If someone's nearby, you'll connect naturally."
          }
        }
      }
